  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "一塊歌"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>郭伊貞</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台61線　縱貫台灣西部沿海地區ê快速公路</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有風車leh pháng　se̍h tín動對故鄉ê siàu念</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">海風重鹹　每一擺ê遠離kap倚近</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lóng有大風沙tī hia se̍h箍輾</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我知影tse就是鹿港風</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我想beh tńg去換一帖相思ê藥單</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">治療久年發癀ê空喙</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kan-na眼--一-下　就ē-tàng解除病疼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">熟sāi ê面容　無閒ê手路</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Huah-hiu一聲koh一聲</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Án-ne ê情境suah tsiânn做愈來愈遠ê夢</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">細漢時ê媽祖宮口　kám iáu原在？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鹿港ê老歲仔kap囡仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是阿公tshuā孫sì-kè leh tshit-thô</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">泉州街　埔頭街　文開路　公會堂　行過洛津</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我知影tse是故鄉ê名</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮兜蹛tī愈來愈遠ê海浴路</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寒冷ê海風伴我行tī無人ê孤燈跤</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我想beh tńg去kap一包青春ê不老藥</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鎮壓tsit粒bē-tàng the-sak ê靈魂</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kan-na眠--一-下　就ē看著少年ê阿爸kap阿母</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風神ê話語　金色ê phua̍h鍊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">廳頭香煙裊裊重重疊疊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Án-ne ê情境suah tsiânn做愈來愈遠ê一塊歌</span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdLUuWo761xZIWAPJHIIcewuvUzbNOMYSyUFgHedLnpoo_4coCcfIkmqbJoymTQ4kN5LxonlgUSD0CEZLudEwvRO0-aL2kNrRSq3b8jmNLLflGHLR_q-NhApA02Y7-tI8D0ekhIcbfP67L-8hFgO5pxZ_t4bsUlUKUzR6LeEbnuo833lsslfuY4f_ydw/s1421/340%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdLUuWo761xZIWAPJHIIcewuvUzbNOMYSyUFgHedLnpoo_4coCcfIkmqbJoymTQ4kN5LxonlgUSD0CEZLudEwvRO0-aL2kNrRSq3b8jmNLLflGHLR_q-NhApA02Y7-tI8D0ekhIcbfP67L-8hFgO5pxZ_t4bsUlUKUzR6LeEbnuo833lsslfuY4f_ydw/w450-h640/340%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjaiyyXTkQbBY8EdMA_fTAtn4EbbBN4bJ-DDvOcPROUF5_wDZEYsbjAv8c4vz8MDJLBFo5XAKrUVvUYZ0aIkcALCIV7q9MgU9N8w-HM8zp5U62rliXiJ314VBTxE9Mh9x51wqwMj9eFZ5iXc4BXa23RlmgsTdtcwKspvGNhJgtUNMKuOfCgt0XWjX-afg/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1340%E6%9C%9F_03.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjaiyyXTkQbBY8EdMA_fTAtn4EbbBN4bJ-DDvOcPROUF5_wDZEYsbjAv8c4vz8MDJLBFo5XAKrUVvUYZ0aIkcALCIV7q9MgU9N8w-HM8zp5U62rliXiJ314VBTxE9Mh9x51wqwMj9eFZ5iXc4BXa23RlmgsTdtcwKspvGNhJgtUNMKuOfCgt0XWjX-afg/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1340%E6%9C%9F_03.jpg\" width=\"454\" /><